    <div begin="00:22.980" end="03:27.300">
      <p begin="00:22.980" end="00:27.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:22.980" end="00:23.350">How</span> <span begin="00:23.350" end="00:23.820">ma</span><span begin="00:23.820" end="00:23.980">ny</span> <span begin="00:23.980" end="00:24.330">win</span><span begin="00:24.330" end="00:25.020">ter</span><span begin="00:25.020" end="00:25.160">s</span> <span begin="00:25.660" end="00:25.830">in</span> <span begin="00:25.830" end="00:26.000">a</span> <span begin="00:26.000" end="00:27.000">ga</span><span begin="00:27.000" end="00:27.120">ze</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凝望的双眼中 究竟掩埋了多少寒冬</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">凝望的雙眼中 究竟掩埋了多少寒冬</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その眼差しは 幾つの冬を越えてきたのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 눈동자 속에 얼마나 많은 겨울이 지나갔는가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Combien d'hivers dans un seul regard</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuántos inviernos en una mirada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie viele Winter in einem einzigen Blick</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quantos invernos em um olhar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сколько зим затаилось в одном лишь взгляде</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quanti inverni in uno sguardo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:27.650" end="00:29.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:27.650" end="00:27.750">Lo</span><span begin="00:27.750" end="00:27.860">st</span> <span begin="00:27.860" end="00:27.980">in</span><span begin="00:27.980" end="00:28.340">si</span><span begin="00:28.340" end="00:28.390">de</span> <span begin="00:28.390" end="00:28.560">a</span> <span begin="00:28.700" end="00:29.720">ma</span><span begin="00:29.720" end="00:29.910">ze?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又在这无解的迷局中 迷失了多久</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又在這無解的迷局中 迷失了多久</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">迷宮の中に迷い込みながら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">길을 잃고 헤매던 미궁 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Perdue au cœur d'un labyrinthe ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Perdida dentro de un laberinto?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verloren in einem Labyrinth?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdida dentro de um labirinto?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потерянном внутри лабиринта</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Persa in un labirinto</span></p>
      <p begin="00:30.810" end="00:35.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:30.810" end="00:30.950">And</span> <span begin="00:30.950" end="00:31.330">how</span> <span begin="00:31.330" end="00:31.820">ma</span><span begin="00:31.820" end="00:31.890">ny</span> <span begin="00:31.970" end="00:32.360">fee</span><span begin="00:32.360" end="00:32.970">ling</span><span begin="00:32.970" end="00:33.100">s</span> <span begin="00:33.640" end="00:33.840">un</span><span begin="00:33.840" end="00:33.900">s</span><span begin="00:33.990" end="00:34.260">po</span><span begin="00:34.340" end="00:35.040">ken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又有多少从未诉诸于口的万千思绪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又有多少從未訴諸於口的萬千思緒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そして 言葉にされなかった幾つの感情を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 입 밖으로 내지 못한 감정들은 얼마나 많이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et combien de sentiments inavoués</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y cuántos sentimientos no dichos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und wie viele unausgesprochene Gefühle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E quantos sentimentos não ditos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сколько чувств так и остались невысказанными</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E quanti sentimenti inespressi</span></p>
      <p begin="00:35.620" end="00:37.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:35.620" end="00:35.970">Hel</span><span begin="00:35.970" end="00:36.020">d</span> <span begin="00:36.020" end="00:36.330">in</span> <span begin="00:36.330" end="00:36.520">thi</span><span begin="00:36.520" end="00:36.670">s</span> <span begin="00:36.670" end="00:37.830">han</span><span begin="00:37.830" end="00:37.880">d?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾被紧紧攥在这掌心里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾被緊緊攥在這掌心裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この手に抱え込んできたのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 손안에 쥐어져 있었던가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sont retenus dans cette main ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Sostenidos en esta mano?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gehalten in dieser Hand?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Guardados nesta mão?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Что я сжимала в этой руке</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Stretti in questa mano</span></p>
      <p begin="00:38.820" end="00:43.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:38.820" end="00:38.920">The</span> <span begin="00:39.000" end="00:39.340">weigh</span><span begin="00:39.340" end="00:39.410">t</span> <span begin="00:39.410" end="00:39.760">o</span><span begin="00:39.760" end="00:39.840">f</span> <span begin="00:39.840" end="00:40.030">the</span> <span begin="00:40.030" end="00:40.240">old</span> <span begin="00:40.240" end="00:40.380">s</span><span begin="00:40.380" end="00:41.100">kie</span><span begin="00:41.100" end="00:41.240">s</span> <span begin="00:41.690" end="00:41.850">on</span> <span begin="00:41.850" end="00:41.920">my</span> <span begin="00:42.010" end="00:42.380">shoul</span><span begin="00:42.380" end="00:43.060">der</span><span begin="00:43.060" end="00:43.190">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双肩之上 承载着旧日天空的沉重</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">雙肩之上 承載著舊日天空的沉重</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">両の肩にのしかかる 古き空の重み</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어깨 위에 지워진 지나간 하늘의 무게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le poids des cieux anciens sur mes épaules</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El peso de los viejos cielos sobre mis hombros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Last der alten Himmel auf meinen Schultern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O peso dos velhos céus sobre os meus ombros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тяжесть былых небес на моих плечах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il peso di cieli antichi sulle mie spalle</span></p>
      <p begin="00:43.620" end="00:45.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:43.620" end="00:44.010">Sun</span><span begin="00:44.010" end="00:44.320">ligh</span><span begin="00:44.320" end="00:44.360">t</span> <span begin="00:44.360" end="00:44.670">in</span> <span begin="00:44.670" end="00:44.810">di</span><span begin="00:44.810" end="00:44.970">s</span><span begin="00:44.970" end="00:45.350">gui</span><span begin="00:45.350" end="00:45.410">se</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不过是隐匿了身形的日光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那不過是隱匿了身形的日光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">姿を変えた太陽の光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어둠 속에 모습을 감춘 햇살</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La lumière du soleil dissimulée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Luz del sol disfrazada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verborgenes Sonnenlicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A luz do sol disfarçada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скрытый солнечный свет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Luce del sole celata</span></p>
      <p begin="00:45.660" end="00:46.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:45.660" end="00:46.010">Who</span> <span begin="00:46.010" end="00:46.470">woul</span><span begin="00:46.470" end="00:46.510">d</span> <span begin="00:46.510" end="00:46.600">ha</span><span begin="00:46.600" end="00:46.680">ve</span> <span begin="00:46.680" end="00:46.960">known</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又有谁能料到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又有誰能料到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">誰が知り得ただろうか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 누가 알았으랴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qui aurait pu imaginer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quién hubiera sabido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wer hätte geahnt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quem saberia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кто мог знать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chi l'avrebbe mai detto</span></p>
      <p begin="00:47.320" end="00:52.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:47.320" end="00:47.640">There</span><span begin="00:47.640" end="00:47.710">'s</span> <span begin="00:47.710" end="00:48.020">a</span><span begin="00:48.020" end="00:48.050">n</span> <span begin="00:48.050" end="00:48.570">en</span><span begin="00:48.570" end="00:48.650">d</span> <span begin="00:48.990" end="00:49.680">to</span> <span begin="00:49.680" end="00:49.880">e</span><span begin="00:49.960" end="00:50.490">ter</span><span begin="00:50.490" end="00:50.680">ni</span><span begin="00:50.680" end="00:52.730">ty?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原来这漫长的永恒 亦有其终点</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">原來這漫長的永恆 亦有其終點</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">永恒にも終わりがあるということを</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">영원에도 끝이 있다는 것을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qu'il existerait une fin à l'éternité ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Que hay un final para la eternidad?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dass die Ewigkeit ein Ende hat?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que existe um fim para a eternidade?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Что у вечности есть конец</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che c'è una fine all'eternità</span></p>
      <p begin="00:53.650" end="00:56.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:53.650" end="00:54.000">The</span> <span begin="00:54.000" end="00:54.520">lo</span><span begin="00:54.520" end="00:54.560">ne</span> <span begin="00:54.950" end="00:55.340">tale</span> <span begin="00:55.340" end="00:55.600">i</span><span begin="00:55.600" end="00:55.790">s</span> <span begin="00:55.790" end="00:55.910">no</span> <span begin="00:55.990" end="00:56.500">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤独流传的荒原古道 自此不复存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">孤獨流傳的荒原古道 自此不復存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">孤独な物語は もう終わりを告げる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고독했던 옛이야기는 이제 없으리</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le conte solitaire n'est plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El relato solitario ya no existe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die einsame Geschichte ist vorüber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O conto solitário não existe mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одинокой повести больше нет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La storia solitaria non esiste più</span></p>
      <p begin="00:56.980" end="01:00.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:56.980" end="00:57.240">A</span><span begin="00:57.240" end="00:57.330">s</span> <span begin="00:57.330" end="00:57.640">a</span> <span begin="00:57.640" end="00:57.890">bree</span><span begin="00:57.890" end="00:57.990">ze</span> <span begin="00:57.990" end="00:58.360">bru</span><span begin="00:58.450" end="00:58.840">she</span><span begin="00:58.840" end="00:58.990">s</span> <span begin="00:58.990" end="01:00.470">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当微风轻轻拂过</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當微風輕輕拂過</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そよ風が頬をかすめ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">한 줄기 미풍이 스쳐 지나가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tandis qu'une brise m'effleure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mientras una brisa roza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während eine Brise sanft vorbeistreicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Enquanto uma brisa passa de leve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда легкий ветерок проносится мимо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mentre una brezza mi accarezza</span></p>
      <p begin="01:00.980" end="01:04.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:00.980" end="01:01.180">A</span><span begin="01:01.180" end="01:01.330">s</span> <span begin="01:01.330" end="01:01.680">the</span> <span begin="01:01.680" end="01:01.940">day</span><span begin="01:01.940" end="01:02.000">s</span> <span begin="01:02.000" end="01:02.360">dri</span><span begin="01:02.360" end="01:02.540">ft</span> <span begin="01:02.540" end="01:03.020">on</span> <span begin="01:03.020" end="01:04.430">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当岁月悄然流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當歲月悄然流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">月日が静かに流れていく中で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">수많은 날이 흘러가는 동안</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tandis que les jours défilent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mientras los días pasan a la deriva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während die Tage dahingleiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Enquanto os dias passam flutuando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда дни безмятежно уплывают прочь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mentre i giorni scorrono via</span></p>
      <p begin="01:04.970" end="01:09.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:04.970" end="01:05.340">Foun</span><span begin="01:05.340" end="01:05.380">d</span> <span begin="01:05.380" end="01:05.530">a</span> <span begin="01:05.530" end="01:05.680">s</span><span begin="01:05.680" end="01:06.010">tea</span><span begin="01:06.010" end="01:06.330">dy</span> <span begin="01:06.330" end="01:06.560">sh</span><span begin="01:06.560" end="01:07.240">ore</span> <span begin="01:07.640" end="01:07.880">o</span><span begin="01:07.880" end="01:07.970">f</span> <span begin="01:07.970" end="01:08.290">t</span><span begin="01:08.290" end="01:08.840">ru</span><span begin="01:08.840" end="01:08.990">s</span><span begin="01:08.990" end="01:09.040">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于在这辽阔的世界中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">終於在這遼闊的世界中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">揺るぎない信頼という岸辺を見つけた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">흔들림 없는 견고한 신뢰의 해안을 찾았네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J'ai trouvé un rivage de confiance absolu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Encontré una orilla firme de confianza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Fand ich ein sicheres Ufer des Vertrauens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Encontrei uma margem firme de confiança</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я нашла надежный берег доверия</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho trovato una sponda sicura di fiducia</span></p>
      <p begin="01:09.040" end="01:11.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:09.040" end="01:09.340">In</span> <span begin="01:09.340" end="01:09.520">thi</span><span begin="01:09.520" end="01:09.670">s</span> <span begin="01:09.670" end="01:10.190">va</span><span begin="01:10.190" end="01:10.380">st</span> <span begin="01:10.380" end="01:11.480">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻得了一处 可以安稳栖息的信任彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">尋得了一處 可以安穩棲息的信任彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この広大な世界の中で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 광활한 세계 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans ce vaste monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En este vasto mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In dieser weiten Welt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Neste vasto mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этом бескрайнем мире</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questo vasto mondo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:12.950" end="01:16.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:12.950" end="01:13.200">A</span><span begin="01:13.200" end="01:13.330">s</span> <span begin="01:13.330" end="01:13.680">we</span> <span begin="01:13.680" end="01:13.890">walk</span> <span begin="01:13.990" end="01:14.490">side</span> <span begin="01:14.490" end="01:14.820">by</span> <span begin="01:14.960" end="01:16.430">si</span><span begin="01:16.430" end="01:16.480">de</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我们并肩而行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當我們並肩而行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちが肩を並べて歩むとき</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 나란히 발맞추어 걸어갈 때</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors que nous marchons côte à côte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mientras caminamos lado a lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während wir Seite an Seite gehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Enquanto caminhamos lado a lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда мы идем плечом к плечу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mentre camminiamo fianco a fianco</span></p>
      <p begin="01:17.010" end="01:20.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:17.010" end="01:17.190">The</span> <span begin="01:17.190" end="01:17.320">s</span><span begin="01:17.320" end="01:17.610">cri</span><span begin="01:17.610" end="01:17.700">pt</span> <span begin="01:17.700" end="01:17.880">i</span><span begin="01:17.880" end="01:18.010">s</span> <span begin="01:18.010" end="01:18.500">fa</span><span begin="01:18.500" end="01:19.000">ding</span> <span begin="01:19.000" end="01:19.490">a</span><span begin="01:19.670" end="01:20.420">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经写就的既定剧本 正在缓缓褪色消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾經寫就的既定劇本 正在緩緩褪色消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">定められた台本は薄れて消えゆき</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오래된 각본은 희미하게 바래어가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le scénario s'efface peu à peu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El guion se desvanece</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verblasst das geschriebene Schicksal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O roteiro está desaparecendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Старый сценарий постепенно угасает</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il copione sta svanendo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:20.990" end="01:24.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:20.990" end="01:21.330">And</span> <span begin="01:21.330" end="01:21.540">the</span> <span begin="01:21.630" end="01:21.920">fro</span><span begin="01:22.000" end="01:22.400">zen</span> <span begin="01:22.500" end="01:23.290">dawn</span> <span begin="01:23.540" end="01:23.660">s</span><span begin="01:23.660" end="01:23.920">tream</span><span begin="01:23.920" end="01:24.020">s</span> <span begin="01:24.020" end="01:24.630">for</span><span begin="01:24.630" end="01:24.690">th</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那原本被冰封的黎明 随之喷涌而出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那原本被冰封的黎明 隨之噴湧而出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">凍てついていた夜明けの光が溢れ出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">얼어붙었던 여명이 뿜어져 나오네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et l'aube gelée se déverse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y el amanecer helado fluye hacia adelante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die gefrorene Morgendämmerung strömt hervor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E o amanhecer congelado flui adiante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И замерзший рассвет прорывается вперед</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E l'alba di ghiaccio sgorga</span></p>
      <p begin="01:25.020" end="01:28.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:25.020" end="01:25.540">In</span><span begin="01:25.670" end="01:26.320">to</span> <span begin="01:26.320" end="01:26.590">the</span> <span begin="01:26.680" end="01:28.990">new</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">汇入那崭新的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">匯入那嶄新的未來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">新たな未来へと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">새로운 미래를 향해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vers ce renouveau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hacia lo nuevo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hinein ins Neue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para dentro do novo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В неизведанное новое</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Verso il nuovo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:47.960" end="01:50.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:47.960" end="01:48.330">Now</span> <span begin="01:48.330" end="01:48.790">I</span> <span begin="01:48.790" end="01:48.960">can</span> <span begin="01:48.960" end="01:50.010">see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时至今日我终于看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">時至今日我終於看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今なら分かる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제야 비로소 보이는구나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Maintenant je peux voir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ahora puedo ver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nun kann ich sehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Agora eu posso ver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Теперь я вижу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ora riesco a vedere</span></p>
      <p begin="01:50.950" end="01:54.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:50.950" end="01:51.320">You</span> <span begin="01:51.320" end="01:51.660">were</span> <span begin="01:51.660" end="01:51.890">al</span><span begin="01:51.990" end="01:52.190">way</span><span begin="01:52.190" end="01:52.340">s</span> <span begin="01:52.340" end="01:52.790">there</span> <span begin="01:52.790" end="01:52.910">for</span> <span begin="01:53.010" end="01:54.270">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你其实一直都在我的身旁守护</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你其實一直都在我的身旁守護</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あなたはいつも 側にいてくれたのだと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그대는 언제나 내 곁에 있어 주었음을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que tu as toujours été là pour moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que siempre estuviste allí para mí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dass du immer für mich da warst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você sempre esteve lá por mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты всегда был рядом со мной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che sei sempre al mio fianco</span></p>
      <p begin="01:54.970" end="01:57.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:54.970" end="01:55.580">Set</span><span begin="01:55.660" end="01:55.830">ting</span> <span begin="01:55.830" end="01:55.930">my</span> <span begin="01:56.010" end="01:56.330">bur</span><span begin="01:56.330" end="01:56.520">den</span> <span begin="01:56.520" end="01:57.100">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于能够将我背负的重担 彻底放下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">終於能夠將我背負的重擔 徹底放下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">背負い続けた重荷を下ろせば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오랫동안 짊어졌던 마음의 짐을 내려놓으니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Posant enfin mon fardeau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dejando mi carga</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich lege meine Last ab</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixando o meu fardo no chão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сбрасывая свое тяжелое бремя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Deponendo il mio fardello</span></p>
      <p begin="01:57.500" end="01:59.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:57.500" end="01:57.610">A</span> <span begin="01:57.610" end="01:57.870">quiet</span> <span begin="01:57.870" end="01:58.030">sp</span><span begin="01:58.030" end="01:58.330">ring</span> <span begin="01:58.330" end="01:58.440">ha</span><span begin="01:58.440" end="01:58.560">s</span> <span begin="01:58.560" end="01:59.130">co</span><span begin="01:59.130" end="01:59.180">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个慷慨而静穆的春天 已经悄然到来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一個慷慨而靜穆的春天 已經悄然到來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">静穏なる春が訪れる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고요하고 평온한 봄이 찾아왔어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un printemps silencieux est arrivé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una primavera silenciosa ha llegado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein stiller Frühling ist angebrochen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um primavera silenciosa chegou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я чувствую как пришла тихая весна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una primavera silenziosa è arrivata</span></p>
