      <p begin="02:40.020" end="02:42.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:40.020" end="02:40.330">In</span> <span begin="02:40.330" end="02:40.520">thi</span><span begin="02:40.520" end="02:40.670">s</span> <span begin="02:40.670" end="02:41.180">va</span><span begin="02:41.180" end="02:41.370">st</span> <span begin="02:41.370" end="02:42.410">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻得了一处 可以安稳栖息的信任彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">尋得了一處 可以安穩棲息的信任彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この広大な世界の中で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 광활한 세계 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans ce vaste monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En este vasto mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In dieser weiten Welt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Neste vasto mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этом бескрайнем мире</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questo vasto mondo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:43.940" end="02:47.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:43.940" end="02:44.190">A</span><span begin="02:44.190" end="02:44.320">s</span> <span begin="02:44.320" end="02:44.650">we</span> <span begin="02:44.650" end="02:44.890">walk</span> <span begin="02:44.980" end="02:45.500">side</span> <span begin="02:45.500" end="02:45.820">by</span> <span begin="02:45.950" end="02:47.390">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我们并肩而行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當我們並肩而行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちが肩を並べて歩むとき</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 나란히 발맞추어 걸어갈 때</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors que nous marchons côte à côte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mientras caminamos lado a lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während wir Seite an Seite gehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Enquanto caminhamos lado a lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда мы идем плечом к плечу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mentre camminiamo fianco a fianco</span></p>
      <p begin="02:47.980" end="02:51.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:47.980" end="02:48.170">The</span> <span begin="02:48.170" end="02:48.300">s</span><span begin="02:48.300" end="02:48.580">cri</span><span begin="02:48.580" end="02:48.680">pt</span> <span begin="02:48.680" end="02:48.870">i</span><span begin="02:48.870" end="02:49.000">s</span> <span begin="02:49.000" end="02:49.500">fa</span><span begin="02:49.500" end="02:50.000">ding</span> <span begin="02:50.000" end="02:50.450">a</span><span begin="02:50.660" end="02:51.380">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经写就的既定剧本 正在缓缓褪色消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾經寫就的既定劇本 正在緩緩褪色消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">定められた台本は薄れて消えゆき</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오래된 각본은 희미하게 바래어가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le scénario s'efface peu à peu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El guion se desvanece</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verblasst das geschriebene Schicksal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O roteiro está desaparecendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Старый сценарий постепенно угасает</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il copione sta svanendo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:52.040" end="02:55.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:52.040" end="02:52.340">And</span> <span begin="02:52.340" end="02:52.540">the</span> <span begin="02:52.630" end="02:52.980">fro</span><span begin="02:52.980" end="02:53.360">zen</span> <span begin="02:53.480" end="02:54.170">dawn</span> <span begin="02:54.500" end="02:54.630">s</span><span begin="02:54.630" end="02:54.880">tream</span><span begin="02:54.880" end="02:54.970">s</span> <span begin="02:54.970" end="02:55.530">for</span><span begin="02:55.530" end="02:55.600">th</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那原本被冰封的黎明 随之喷涌而出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那原本被冰封的黎明 隨之噴湧而出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">凍てついていた夜明けの光が溢れ出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">얼어붙었던 여명이 뿜어져 나오네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et l'aube gelée se déverse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y el amanecer helado fluye hacia adelante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die gefrorene Morgendämmerung strömt hervor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E o amanhecer congelado flui adiante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И замерзший рассвет прорывается вперед</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E l'alba di ghiaccio sgorga</span></p>
      <p begin="02:55.990" end="02:59.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:55.990" end="02:56.210">The</span> <span begin="02:56.310" end="02:56.650">weigh</span><span begin="02:56.650" end="02:56.690">t</span> <span begin="02:56.690" end="02:56.990">of</span> <span begin="02:56.990" end="02:57.350">ye</span><span begin="02:57.350" end="02:57.510">s</span><span begin="02:57.510" end="02:57.980">ter</span><span begin="02:57.980" end="02:59.420">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昨日所留下的沉重枷锁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">昨日所留下的沉重枷鎖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">昨日までの重みが</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지나간 어제의 묵직한 무게는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le fardeau d'hier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El peso del ayer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Last von gestern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O peso de ontem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Груз вчерашнего дня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il peso di ieri</span></p>
      <p begin="02:59.950" end="03:03.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:59.950" end="03:00.190">Will</span> <span begin="03:00.310" end="03:00.640">ne</span><span begin="03:00.640" end="03:00.960">ver</span> <span begin="03:00.960" end="03:01.390">hold</span> <span begin="03:01.480" end="03:02.000">me</span> <span begin="03:02.000" end="03:02.640">a</span><span begin="03:02.640" end="03:03.500">gai</span><span begin="03:03.500" end="03:03.560">n</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也无法将我的前路困阻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再也無法將我的前路困阻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">二度と私を縛り付けることはない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더는 나를 붙잡아매지 못하리니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me retiendra plus jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nunca más me retendrá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird mich nie wieder zurückhalten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca mais vai me prender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Больше никогда не удержит меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non mi tratterrà mai più</span></p>
      <p begin="03:03.980" end="03:07.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:03.980" end="03:04.190">Cau</span><span begin="03:04.190" end="03:04.330">se</span> <span begin="03:04.330" end="03:04.660">when</span> <span begin="03:04.660" end="03:04.880">the</span> <span begin="03:04.970" end="03:05.320">tide</span><span begin="03:05.320" end="03:05.490">s</span> <span begin="03:05.490" end="03:06.180">turn</span> <span begin="03:06.620" end="03:06.940">and</span> <span begin="03:06.940" end="03:07.170">s</span><span begin="03:07.170" end="03:07.830">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为当命运的潮汐开始翻涌摇曳之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為當命運的潮汐開始翻湧搖曳之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">潮の満ち引きが変わり 揺れ動こうとも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시대의 조류가 뒤바뀌고 흔들릴지라도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Car lorsque les marées tourneront et basculeront</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque cuando las mareas giren y oscilen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn wenn die Gezeiten sich wenden und wogen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque quando as marés virarem e balançarem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь когда приливы меняются и колеблются</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché quando le maree cambiano e oscillano</span></p>
      <p begin="03:08.020" end="03:10.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:08.020" end="03:08.360">We'll</span> <span begin="03:08.360" end="03:08.700">know</span> <span begin="03:08.700" end="03:09.190">our</span> <span begin="03:09.360" end="03:10.610">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们早已明晰了 属于我们的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們早已明晰了 屬於我們的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちは進むべき道を知っているから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리는 우리가 나아갈 길을 알 터이기에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous connaîtrons notre chemin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Conoceremos nuestro camino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werden wir unseren Weg kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nós saberemos o nosso caminho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы будем знать свой путь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Noi sapremo quale strada prendere</span></p>
      <p begin="03:11.960" end="03:15.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="03:11.960" end="03:12.150">Don't</span> <span begin="03:12.320" end="03:12.660">need</span> <span begin="03:12.660" end="03:12.920">to</span> <span begin="03:13.000" end="03:13.540">be</span> <span begin="03:13.540" end="03:13.890">a</span><span begin="03:13.890" end="03:14.020">f</span><span begin="03:14.020" end="03:15.430">raid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自此无需再去惶恐害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">自此無需再去惶恐害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐れる必要などない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려워할 필요는 없네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nul besoin d'avoir peur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay necesidad de tener miedo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Brauchen uns nicht zu fürchten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não precisa ter medo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нам незачем больше бояться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non c'è bisogno di avere paura</span></p>
      <p begin="03:15.940" end="03:19.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:15.940" end="03:16.130">Set</span> <span begin="03:16.280" end="03:16.680">sail</span> <span begin="03:16.680" end="03:16.980">and</span> <span begin="03:16.980" end="03:17.520">row</span> <span begin="03:17.520" end="03:18.010">a</span><span begin="03:18.010" end="03:19.420">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扬帆起航 向着远方破浪前行吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">揚帆起航 向著遠方破浪前行吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">帆を揚げて 漕ぎ出そう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">돛을 올리고 저 편으로 노를 저어가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Hissons les voiles et ramons au loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Zarpemos y rememos lejos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Setzen die Segel und rudern fort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Içar as velas e remar para longe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расправь паруса и плыви прочь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Spiega le vele e rema via</span></p>
      <p begin="03:19.970" end="03:22.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:19.970" end="03:20.350">Ne</span><span begin="03:20.350" end="03:20.540">ver</span> <span begin="03:20.630" end="03:20.840">felt</span> <span begin="03:20.980" end="03:21.330">so</span> <span begin="03:21.480" end="03:22.170">sa</span><span begin="03:22.170" end="03:22.220">fe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未感到过 如此的安心与踏实</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">從未感到過 如此的安心與踏實</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これほど安らかな気持ちはなかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 안온하게 느껴진 적이 없었으니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne me suis jamais sentie aussi en sécurité</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nunca me sentí tan segura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Habe mich noch nie so sicher gefühlt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca me senti tão segura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я никогда не чувствовала себя в такой безопасности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non mi sono mai sentita così al sicuro</span></p>
      <p begin="03:22.600" end="03:27.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:22.600" end="03:22.960">Wi</span><span begin="03:22.960" end="03:23.020">th</span> <span begin="03:23.020" end="03:23.530">you,</span> <span begin="03:23.530" end="03:23.900">I</span> <span begin="03:23.980" end="03:24.240">can</span> <span begin="03:24.240" end="03:24.340">s</span><span begin="03:24.340" end="03:24.530">te</span><span begin="03:24.690" end="03:24.720">p</span> <span begin="03:24.720" end="03:24.920">in</span><span begin="03:25.000" end="03:25.340">to</span> <span begin="03:25.340" end="03:25.470">the</span> <span begin="03:25.560" end="03:27.300">new</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要与你同行 我便能坦然踏入这崭新的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只要與你同行 我便能坦然踏入這嶄新的未來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あなたとなら 私は新しい世界へと踏み出せる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그대와 함께라면 나는 새로운 내일로 걸어 나갈 수 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec toi je peux marcher vers ce renouveau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Contigo, puedo dar un paso hacia lo nuevo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit dir kann ich ins Neue schreiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com você, eu posso dar o passo para dentro do novo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вместе с тобой я могу шагнуть в это новое</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Con te posso fare un passo verso il nuovo</span></p>
